{"4288290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Recess", "steam_appid": 4288290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4887760], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the bell rings… chaos begins.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recess</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer party game where classic playground games turn into all-out competition. Run, hide, throw, and outplay your friends across a variety of imaginative maps inspired by childhood memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>online with up to 10 players</strong>, or bring friends together with <strong>up to 4 players on one screen — even in online matches</strong>. Whether you're teaming up or going head-to-head, every round is quick, chaotic, and full of unexpected moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Games, Reimagined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match rotates through different playground favorites — simple rules, unpredictable outcomes, nonstop chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag</strong> – Don’t be “it” when the clock hits zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze Tag</strong> – Free your teammates before everyone gets iced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek</strong> – Stay hidden… or hunt them all down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sardines</strong> – One hides. Everyone searches. It gets crowded fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag</strong> – Steal it. Defend it. Don’t get caught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is quick. Every round matters. Every round changes the leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Childhood Worlds Come to Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across colorful arenas inspired by places you remember — and some you only imagined.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively <strong>school</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful <strong>playground</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic <strong>shopping mall</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious <strong>abandoned factory</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful indoor <strong>play place</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rustic <strong>summer camp</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map changes how you play, offering new strategies and surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make It Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character’s colors and style before jumping into the chaos. Stand out on the playground and make sure everyone knows exactly who just tagged them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer – Up to 10 Players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer - Up to 4 local players on one screen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix local + online for the ultimate party setup</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win the Match. Remember the Moment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Points stack. Rounds rotate. Rivalries grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But whether you’re sprinting across the playground, hiding in the mall, or diving for cover in dodgeball — it’s the chaos with your friends that makes it unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bell rings… will you be on top?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the bell rings… chaos begins.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recess</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer party game where classic playground games turn into all-out competition. Run, hide, throw, and outplay your friends across a variety of imaginative maps inspired by childhood memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>online with up to 10 players</stro