g\" >Make It Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character’s colors and style before jumping into the chaos. Stand out on the playground and make sure everyone knows exactly who just tagged them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer – Up to 10 Players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer - Up to 4 local players on one screen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix local + online for the ultimate party setup</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win the Match. Remember the Moment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Points stack. Rounds rotate. Rivalries grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But whether you’re sprinting across the playground, hiding in the mall, or diving for cover in dodgeball — it’s the chaos with your friends that makes it unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bell rings… will you be on top?</p>", "short_description": "A chaotic multiplayer party game where childhood playground games turn into all-out competition. Tag, hide, chase, and outplay your friends across imaginative maps all before the bell rings.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288290/498b37631e26f725bb4148d26a656ba7d8ce0c4b/header.jpg?t=1782230422", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288290/866f9ffe0efa34df86dd8e438c57fb9e8340a5e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782230422", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288290/866f9ffe0efa34df86dd8e438c57fb9e8340a5e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782230422", "website": "https://lostechoes-d9x36ejb.manus.space", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br>